    <string name="welcome_title">Let\'s make sure alarms work</string>
    <string name="welcome_text">RinAlarm needs a few permissions so alarms ring on time and show over the lock screen. It takes about a minute, and nothing here uses the internet.</string>
    <!-- 05e companion safety (6.2): she is an AI, said once up front and kept on the settings page. -->
    <string name="about_rin_title">About Rin</string>
    <string name="privacy_title">How Rin uses your data</string>
    <string name="privacy_summary">Everything stays on your phone. The full privacy notice.</string>
    <string name="privacy_missing">The privacy notice is missing from this build. It is also at github.com/Earthkodyai/rin (PRIVACY.md).</string>
    <string name="about_rin">Rin is an AI character. Her voice and lines were made with AI and are built into the app; nothing you say or do leaves your phone.</string>
    <string name="notif_title">Allow notifications</string>
    <string name="notif_text">When an alarm rings, its screen appears over the lock screen through a notification. Without it you\'ll still hear the alarm, but you\'ll have to open RinAlarm to stop it.</string>
    <string name="notif_allow">Allow notifications</string>
    <string name="fsi_title">Full-screen alarms</string>
    <string name="fsi_text">Lets the ring screen fill the lock screen, like an incoming call. Without it the alarm shows as a notification; the sound is the same.</string>
    <string name="exact_title">Exact alarm timing</string>
    <string name="exact_text">Android 12 asks you to allow alarms at an exact time. Without it, alarms may ring minutes late.</string>
    <string name="brand_title">Xiaomi settings</string>
    <string name="brand_text">HyperOS can stop apps in the background. RinAlarm can\'t read these settings, so please check them yourself. The first one lets the ring page appear over the lock screen.</string>
    <string name="brand_lock_screen">Allow Show on Lock screen</string>
    <string name="brand_autostart">Turn on Autostart</string>
    <string name="brand_battery">Set Battery to No restrictions</string>
    <string name="skip_title">Skip this step?</string>
    <string name="skip_notifications_text">Without notifications the ring screen can\'t appear. The alarm still sounds; to stop it, open RinAlarm. You can turn this on later in Diagnostics.</string>
    <string name="skip_exact_text">Without exact timing, alarms may ring several minutes late. You can fix this later in Diagnostics.</string>
    <string name="skip_confirm">Skip anyway</string>
    <string name="skip_cancel">Go back</string>

